    {
      "key": "game.sixth.level.you.are.seriously.collecting.parking.spots.fine.let.m",
      "text": "Sixth level.\nYou are seriously collecting\nparking spots.\n\nFine. Let me be very clear:\nFill your tank. Fly up.\nAnd don't stop just because\nthe landing pad disappears from view.\n\nThe edge of the screen is not a wall.\nI really thought you would\ntry that yourself eventually."
    },
    {
      "key": "game.slow.your.descent.before.touching.down",
      "text": "Slow your descent before touching down."
