      "key": "game.storage.says.it.is.not.their.problem",
      "text": "Storage says it is not their problem."
    },
    {
      "key": "game.supposed.to.no.you.just.happen.to.have.the.ship.and.very.little.s",
      "text": "Supposed to? No. You just happen to have the ship and very little supervision."
